    "mono": "JetBrains Mono"
  },
  "rules": [
    "Gradient (grad_from -> grad_to) ONLY on level/progress fills: OSD level bar, progress bars, disk usage bars. Never on buttons, switches, calendar today, menu button.",
    "Calendar today = perfect circle (equal width and height), solid accent, accent_fg text.",
    "Accent is one swappable token set; never hardcode accent hex outside tokens.",
    "Fill contrast (grad_from, grad_to, disk_fill, level_low, level_high) is measured against the window surface (>= 3:1), not against the track; track is a light shape only.",
    "level_low/level_high are status colours: used only where the widget itself signals the state (GtkLevelBar offsets, e.g. baobab). Disk bars without thresholds (Nemo sidebar) keep disk_fill."
  ]
}
